message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ABTC: Adaptive Bayesian Thresholding Classifier"
version: "1.0.0"  # Updated from 0.x
abstract: >-
  ABTC is a model-agnostic framework combining Bayesian posterior 
  recalibration with single-layer grid search for metric- or 
  cost-optimal threshold selection.
